/build/
# Resolved deps — `cyrius deps` populates lib/ from cyrius.cyml [deps] stdlib +
# [deps.kavach] / [deps.sigil]. Reproducible from the toolchain pin + the tracked
# cyrius.lock, so lib/ is not committed (matches kavach/sigil/patra). CI runs
# `cyrius deps` before every build.
/lib/
*.core
.claude/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
